  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Using `BeautifulSoup` or the `read_html` function extract the table with `Tesla Revenue` and store it into a dataframe named `tesla_revenue`. The dataframe should have columns `Date` and `Revenue`.\n"
   ]
